  ('challenger-75', 'challenger', 'court-position', 1, 'Positioning rep 65: on the deep right corner, a high deep ball is landing near your baseline. Where should you move by default?', '[{"id":"a","label":"Crowd the bounce"},{"id":"b","label":"Charge forward early"},{"id":"c","label":"Give yourself space behind the bounce"},{"id":"d","label":"Stand in no-man’s-land"}]'::jsonb, 'c', 'High deep balls require space so you can strike in balance.', '{"player":{"x":82,"y":94},"opponent":{"x":45,"y":9},"ball":{"x":76,"y":90},"recommendedPath":[{"x":82,"y":94},{"x":50,"y":82}],"caption":"Positioning rep 65: you are on the deep right corner while a high deep ball is landing near your baseline."}'::jsonb, 'ITF Coaching resources (tactical concepts, paraphrased)', 'https://www.itftennis.com/en/growing-the-game/coaching/', true, true),
