  ('challenger-77', 'challenger', 'court-position', 1, 'Positioning rep 67: on the deep right corner, the opponent hits from a corner. Where should you move by default?', '[{"id":"a","label":"Shade recovery toward the open attacking lane"},{"id":"b","label":"Ignore the open court"},{"id":"c","label":"Run behind the fence"},{"id":"d","label":"Stand on the wrong alley"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'Opponent position changes their angles, so shade toward the space they can attack.', '{"player":{"x":82,"y":83},"opponent":{"x":45,"y":10},"ball":{"x":76,"y":74},"recommendedPath":[{"x":82,"y":83},{"x":50,"y":82}],"caption":"Positioning rep 67: you are on the deep right corner while the opponent hits from a corner."}'::jsonb, 'ITF Coaching resources (tactical concepts, paraphrased)', 'https://www.itftennis.com/en/growing-the-game/coaching/', true, true),
