  ('rookie-128', 'rookie', 'rules', 2, 'In doubles clinic scenario 118, what is the correct rule for change of ends?', '[{"id":"a","label":"After every point"},{"id":"b","label":"Only after each set"},{"id":"c","label":"After even-numbered games"},{"id":"d","label":"After odd-numbered games"}]'::jsonb, 'd', 'Players normally change ends after odd-numbered games.', null, 'ITF Rules of Tennis (2026)', 'https://www.itftennis.com/en/about-us/governance/rules-and-regulations/', true, false),
