  ('rookie-93', 'rookie', 'rules', 1, 'In junior drill scenario 83, what is the correct rule for score-calling order?', '[{"id":"a","label":"The server’s score is called first"},{"id":"b","label":"The receiver’s score is called first"},{"id":"c","label":"The higher score is called first"},{"id":"d","label":"Either order is fine"}]'::jsonb, 'a', 'The server’s score is always announced first in a game score.', null, 'ITF Rules of Tennis (2026)', 'https://www.itftennis.com/en/about-us/governance/rules-and-regulations/', true, false),
